    "tags": [],
    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><strong>Shared Burden Harness.</strong> Your armor and rigging are built to pull impact off other people.</p><ul><li>When a creature you can see within 6 squares takes damage, you can use your reaction to take some of that damage onto yourself.</li><li>Reduce the damage the target takes by an amount equal to your <strong>tier</strong>, and you take the same amount of damage (this transfer occurs after resistance/vulnerability is applied).</li><li>You can use this feature a number of times per Soma Break equal to your Body modifier (minimum 1).</li></ul><p>You have literally welded your life onto your friends’ Athletics curves.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
